    "detailed_description": "Aeterna: Rubra Plena is a visual novel otome game about happy romance and dealing with depression, anxiety, and trauma. The game does not contain toxic relationship dynamics - all love interests will love you for who you are.<br><br>The game is set in the Astrals - the capital of Sectus, a dying land suffering from radioactive pollution - in the world of Thealia. It is a magicpunk themed universe, where electricity is created from a radioactive material found deep underground.<br><br>You play as a beautiful young noblewoman dealing with her current and past experiences while finding love.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285730/extras/67d87371027395a8c5579cfc5063c56a.avif?t=1704229193\" /></span><br><br>Norelia (renamable) has been pushed into depression due to her past life. Once a social butterfly, she has lost the will to uphold her previous social life and distances herself from others, seeing them as faceless figures and dolls with strings attached.<br><br>That is, until she meets a special someone. She starts to feel emotions she forgot were possible to feel. But her life is about to be turned upside down once again as she is arrested for a crime she did not commit and plunged into the depths of the Astrals, where she now has to fend for herself in a place that despises her very being.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose between four gorgeous love interests - three males and one female.<br></li><li>Experience happy romantic relationships with a cast that is only interested in you.<br></li><li>Customize the heroine's name, and define her preferences as you play.<br></li><li>Explore multiple endings per route.<br></li><li>Keep track of collected lore, CGs, and endings.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Love Interests</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285730/extras/ad87625287e4a01cda898a424200bd1c.avif?t=1704229193\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285730/extras/9f0a7cc57bb9342ba5428207d1486e3c.avif?t=1704229193\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285730/extras/be619bbc5c9866c14a1bc00c3c6a34e4.avif?t=1704229193\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285730/extras/d238b16338a08db13861081535b3d02b.avif?t=1704229193\" /></span>",
